OL,3,GNEWSAPlane landed with 'minutes of
OL,4,Afuel' left
OL,5,
OL,6,FA passenger jet carrying 171 people
OL,7,Flanded with about one per cent of its
OL,8,Ffuel remaining after severe weather and
OL,9,Fa series of diversions left it with
OL,10,Fonly minutes to spare, an air safety
OL,11,Freport said.
OL,13,FThe Boeing 737 had been due to fly from
OL,14,FPisa, Italy, to Prestwick, near
OL,15,FGlasgow, on 3 October last year, before
OL,16,Fbeing diverted via Edinburgh and
OL,17,Feventually landing in Manchester.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,410,400,260,160,0,100
