OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAPlane landed with 'minutes of
OL,4,Afuel' left
OL,5,
OL,6,FDuring Storm Amy, the aircraft
OL,7,Fencountered three separate wind shear
OL,8,Fevents, a change in wind speed and
OL,9,Fdirection at different heights, and a
OL,10,Frequest to divert to Manchester was
OL,11,Finitially refused.
OL,13,FManchester Airport said its policy was
OL,14,Fto accept diversion requests if the
OL,15,Fairport had the capacity to receive the
OL,16,Faircraft.
